T*
( 6. Page Object Model The framework separates page-specific browser interactions from test) Tj
T*
( scenarios. - LoginPage.java - login page actions and elements. - DashboardPage.java - dashboard) Tj
T*
( interactions. - PatientsPage.java - patient management interactions. - AppointmentsPage.java -) Tj
T*
( appointment management interactions. - BasePage.java - common page-level functionality.) Tj
T*
( Benefits include reduced duplicated Selenium code, separation of locators from workflows,) Tj
T*
( easier maintenance, improved readability and support for additional workflows. 7. Cucumber BDD) Tj
T*
( Cucumber allows test scenarios to be written in Gherkin syntax. Java step definitions connect) Tj
T*
( the readable steps to Selenium operations. Feature: Healthcare user authentication Scenario:) Tj
T*
( Admin logs in successfully Given the user opens the healthcare application When the admin) Tj
T*
( enters valid credentials And the admin clicks the login button Then the admin should see the) Tj
T*
( dashboard Benefits include readable scenarios, separation of business behaviour from) Tj
T*
( implementation, and improved test documentation. 8. Maven and Local Application Maven manages) Tj
T*
( dependencies and test execution. The project uses Selenium Java 4.25.0, Cucumber 7.20.1,) Tj
T*
( Cucumber JUnit 7.20.1 and JUnit 4.13.2. Run tests locally mvn clean test Start the local) Tj
T*
( CarePoint demo application python -m http.server 8080 --directory app/demo Application URL:) Tj
T*
( http://localhost:8080. Keep the local server running in a separate terminal while executing) Tj
T*
( Selenium tests. 9. Jenkins CI Integration A Jenkins Freestyle job named) Tj
T*
( Healthcare-Automation-Framework was configured. Jenkins is available locally at) Tj
T*
( http://localhost:8081. - Configured Java 21 as the Jenkins runtime. - Configured Maven as a) Tj
T*
( Jenkins build tool. - Configured a Windows batch build step to run mvn clean test. - Copied) Tj
T*
( generated reports into the Jenkins workspace. - Configured HTML Publisher to publish the) Tj
T*
( report. HTML Publisher configuration Setting Value HTML directory to archive reports Index page) Tj
T*
( index.html Report title Healthcare Cucumber Test ReportHealthcare Management System Automation) Tj
T*
( Framework Page 3) Tj
T*
