T*
(   Resume-Ready Project Summary Healthcare Management System - Test Automation Framework Java |) Tj
T*
(   Selenium WebDriver | Cucumber BDD | JUnit | Maven | Jenkins | GitHub - Developed a healthcare) Tj
T*
(   UI automation framework using Java, Selenium WebDriver and Cucumber BDD, covering six) Tj
T*
(   scenarios across authentication, patient registration, appointment booking and logout. -) Tj
T*
(   Implemented Page Object Model with reusable page, driver, configuration and test utility) Tj
T*
(   components. - Integrated Jenkins with GitHub to automate Maven test execution following) Tj
T*
(   repository changes. - Configured Cucumber HTML, JSON and XML reporting and resolved Jenkins) Tj
T*
(   workspace report-publishing issues through automated report copying. 16. Interview) Tj
T*
(   Explanation "I developed a Healthcare Management System Automation Framework using Java,) Tj
T*
(   Selenium WebDriver, Cucumber BDD, JUnit and Maven. I automated important workflows such as) Tj
T*
(   admin and staff login, invalid login validation, patient registration, appointment booking) Tj
T*
(   and logout. I followed the Page Object Model to make the framework reusable and maintainable.) Tj
T*
(   I then integrated the project with Jenkins and GitHub. When code is pushed to GitHub, Jenkins) Tj
T*
(   can trigger a new build and execute the Maven test suite. One practical challenge I solved) Tj
T*
(   was Jenkins report publishing. My Cucumber reports were generated in the project directory,) Tj
T*
(   but Jenkins HTML Publisher expected them in its workspace. I updated the build process to) Tj
T*
(   copy the report files into the workspace before publishing them. This project helped me gain) Tj
T*
(   practical experience in UI automation, BDD, version control, CI integration, test reporting) Tj
T*
(   and troubleshooting."Healthcare Management System Automation Framework Page 5) Tj
T*
